  "unitId": "phase2_unit10",
  "title": "Negatives",
  "description": "don't / doesn't / didn't / wasn't / weren't",
  "level": "A2",
  "explain": {
    "ta": "எதிர்மறை வாக்கியங்களை உருவாக்க don't/doesn't/didn't அல்லது wasn't/weren't பயன்படுத்துகிறோம். செயல் வினைச்சொற்களுக்கு don't/doesn't/didn't பயன்படுத்துகிறோம். Be வினைச்சொற்களுக்கு wasn't/weren't பயன்படுத்துகிறோம. நிகழ்காலத்தில் I/You/We/They-க்கு 'don't', He/She/It-க்கு 'doesn't' பயன்படுத்துகிறோம். இறந்த காலத்திற்கு எல்லோருக்கும் 'didn't' பயன்படுத்துகிறோம.",
    "en": "We use don't/doesn't/didn't or wasn't/weren't to form negative sentences. Use don't/doesn't/didn't with action verbs. Use wasn't/weren't with be-verbs. In present tense, use 'don't' with I/You/We/They and 'doesn't' with He/She/It. For past tense, use 'didn't' for all subjects. The main verb stays in base form."
  },
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": "I don't like coffee.",
